itorial_proposal","title":"代表、分组发言、送礼和握手的模型判断","scope":"源答案只给排列或组合，解释为有源整理，不添加计数。","blocks":[{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"六名班委选三名发言代表；再改为选三名分别担任第一、二、三组代表。舞蹈社团十二名学生，两人互送一份礼物；再改为两人互握一次手。分别判别排列或组合。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:homework-classification:b0"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"不分职务的三代表是组合；分别担当第一、二、三组角色为排列。送礼须区分赠送者与接受者，为排列；握手不区分双方的书写次序，为组合。参考答案依次为组合、排列、排列、组合，未给计数。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:homework-classification:b1"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"}],"contentOrigin":"source_based_reconstruction","wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","titleWordingStatus":"editorial_normalized_title","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"按本题实际任务和现有节点语义匹配；不从共用运算推定先修。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book5:L205:homework-classification:b0","sourceId":"L205","sourceSha256":"cb3580db5d2ae404559fedc333c7ae3d669d8785a61d2342409452095aa36951","locator":{"headingPath":["代表、分组发言、送礼和握手的模型判断"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":197,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":14,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null,"printedPageNote":"原页无独立印刷页码，保留PDF页锚。","supportingParagraphIndices":[197,198,200,201],"supportingRenderedPages":[14,15]},"quote":"从6名班委中选出3名","quoteRepresentation":"native_text_short_quote","quoteCompleteness":"原文字层中的短引；完整有源整理另列","transcriptionWordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceSupportedTranscription":"六名班委选三名发言代表；再改为选三名分别担任第一、二、三组代表。舞蹈社团十二名学生，两人互送一份礼物；再改为两人互握一次手。分别判别排列或组合。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"mathSourceAssets":[],"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L205","requestedPath":"increments/l205-v1/evidence/L205/page-14.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L205.docx","sourceTitle":"6.3组合（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book5:L205:homework-classification:b1","sourceId":"L205","sourceSha256":"cb3580db5d2ae404559fedc333c7ae3d669d8785a61d2342409452095aa36951","locator":{"headingPath":["代表、分组发言、送礼和握手的模型判断"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":218,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":16,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null,"printedPageNote":"原页无独立印刷页码，保留PDF页锚。","supportingParagraphIndices":[218,219]},"quote":"组合问题","quoteRepresentation":"native_text_short_quote","quoteCompleteness":"原文字层中的短引；完整有源整理另列","transcriptionWordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceSupportedTranscription":"不分职务的三代表是组合；分别担当第一、二、三组角色为排列。送礼须区分赠送者与接受者，为排列；握手不区分双方的书写次序，为组合。参考答案依次为组合、排列、排列、组合，未给计数。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"mathSourceAssets":[],"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L205","requestedPath":"increments/l205-v1/evidence/L205/page-16.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L205.docx","sourceTitle":"6.3组合（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"}],"bodyAssets":{},"formulaRecords":[]},{"id":"lesson-content:L205:model-classification","nodeId":"kp:21406","proposedNodeId":"proposal:book-5:permutation-combination-order-test","kind":"method_application","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"按结果是否区分顺序判别排列组合","scope":"源概括的判别与四题全部分析；本批不补未给数值。","blocks":[{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"源判别关键：从$n$个互异元素取$m\\le n$个后，结果是否需要区分顺序；需要则排列，不需要则组合。先把实际问题抽象为元素和取法，再核是否按顺序排列。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b0"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"例1：（1）10学生任取5人参观展览；（2）从1、2、3、4、5取两个不同数作一点的坐标；（3）八张卡片写1、2、3、5、10、16、32、50，任取两张相加求不同结果；（4）四本不同书分别送四个人，每人一本。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b1"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"（1）取人不区分次序，是组合。（2）坐标的第一、第二分量有次序，是排列；若改为两个不同数组成集合，因为集合元素无序，则是组合。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b2"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"（3）源指出任取两卡所得的和没有重复，且不依两卡顺序，例如$16+32=32+16=48$，故是组合问题。必须同时保留各对和无重复这一题设数值性质，不能对任意卡片数无条件推广。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b3"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"（4）先将四个人按固定顺序排列，把送书对应为四本书排列，故为排列问题。源没有给这四问的计数答案。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b4"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"}],"contentOrigin":"source_based_reconstruction","wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","titleWordingStatus":"editorial_normalized_title","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"按本题实际任务和现有节点语义匹配；不从共用运算推定先修。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book5:L205:model-classification:b0","sourceId":"L205","sourceSha256":"cb3580db5d2ae404559fedc333c7ae3d669d8785a61d2342409452095aa36951","locator":{"headingPath":["按结果是否区分顺序判别排列组合"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":158,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":11,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null,"printedPageNote":"原页无独立印刷页码，保留PDF页锚。"},"quote":"关键在于判断","quoteRepresentation":"native_text_short_quote","quoteCompleteness":"原文字层中的短引；完整有源整理另列","transcriptionWordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceSupportedTranscription":"源判别关键：从$n$个互异元素取$m\\le n$个后，结果是否需要区分顺序；需要则排列，不需要则组合。先把实际问题抽象为元素和取法，再核是否按顺序排列。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"mathSourceAssets":[{"path":"increments/l205-v1/evidence/L205/objects/image1.wmf","sourcePart":"word/media/image1.wmf","sha256":"1a19b3566a1a710e7ae03ef51feef8d4fec3510e8157f7671b76c0ea35006d27"},{"path":"increments/l205-v1/evidence/L205/objects/image2.wmf","sourcePart":"word/media/image2.wmf","sha256":"52b134fc61a472feac61deb2740b1187cd74dcebadc053090f9479eac9caddd2"},{"path":"increments/l205-v1/evidence/L205/objects/image24.wmf","sourcePart":"word/media/image24.wmf","sha256":"87a8f739ee85360c2480c74479a2b4852649ac3592ccd2fcbaed65f853b9b844"}],"rawMetadataRetainedInOrigi